      "content": "Wait, what kind of issues? I'm just worried about it not working or something. Like, is it actually going to make the pill fail? You sounded kind of unsure about the interaction but then told me I could just take them 30 mins apart so it's fine. I just want to be sure I won't get pregnant because of it.",
